      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The constant noise is a sign that your mind is trying to protect you from the pain of losing your identity, but it doesn't mean you have to endure it forever. Peace is found not in finding a new purpose, but in finally allowing yourself to stop fighting the silence and accept that you are allowed to exist without being a creator. There is no shame in letting go of the weight of an empty shell, because the moment you stop pretending to have something to give, the exhausting noise will finally fade.",
